docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:13:**Law 0.1**: Layer 0 MUST NOT import any amun-* crate.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:14:**Law 0.2**: Only cryptographic, serialization, and constant-time utility crates.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:15:**Law 0.3**: Single source of canonical encoding truth.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:20:**Law 0.5.1**: MAY import Layer 0. MUST NOT import Layers 1-4.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:21:**Law 0.5.2**: Governance semantics are NOT kernel primitives.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:26:**Law I.1**: Traits ONLY. No concrete service implementations.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:27:**Law I.2**: Std/core impls (Debug, Display, Error, From, Clone) permitted.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:28:**Law I.3**: Service impls (Tcp, Http, Ws, Network, Store, Runtime, Tokio) FORBIDDEN.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:29:**Law I.4**: `Send + Sync` MUST be documented with `@constitutional-runtime-contract`.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:30:**Law I.5**: NO async runtime dependencies.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:36:**Law 1.1**: MUST NOT import `amun-runtime`, `amun-storage`, `amun-mempool`.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:41:**Law 2.1**: MUST be deterministic and replayable.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:46:**Law 3.1**: MUST NOT depend on consensus logic.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:51:**Law 4.1**: Primary host for tokio/hyper. MUST NOT contain consensus logic.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:56:**Law 5.1**: Transitions MUST be replay-deterministic.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:61:**Law 6.1**: No production crate MAY depend on a test crate.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:63:## Article II: Async Runtime Laws
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:65:**Law Async.1**: tokio/hyper MAY exist outside Layer 4 ONLY behind deterministic interfaces.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:66:**Law Async.2**: Async runtimes MUST NOT alter deterministic protocol behavior.
docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_CONSTITUTION.md:67:**Law Async.3**: Optional async deps require constitutional review.
